t by the hour is arranged for in advance of the trip.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8089c710-8a92-5a26-a3b2-1965e5e5f419"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.65.140","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.65.140","content_hash":"d941d2f329031d3cabdcbabc557d38c19e12d3aa72e1bd4a82b8d5b5c74b7771","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.65.140:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.65.140:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.65.140","text":"(c) A fuel surcharge shall be added to the total fare. The surcharge shall depend on the average price of regular, unleaded gasoline in Topeka as determined by AAA of Kansas. If the average cost of regular, unleaded gasoline is $3.00 or more per gallon, but less than $4.00, a surcharge of $1.00 shall be added, per trip.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"0fa0f48d-7fdd-5bfc-87f8-de9663abbba0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.65.140","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.65.140","content_hash":"02efddb79c7475923745b2f02ac53654e41055c062d092138989046cc4c10dfc","heading":null,"ordinal":17,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.65.140:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.65.140:block:17","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.65.140","text":"The surcharge shall be $1.50 per trip when the average price of regular, unleaded gasoline is $4.00 or more per gallon. (Ord. 19145 § 1, 8-19-08. Code 1995 § 154-121.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4768a84e-cb38-56e7-89e2-de59440e26b3"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.65.140","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.65.140","content_hash":"64f4a1388ad4f2dc8c4de431601d8781b33610d354c6069